    {
      "id": "same_sign_selector_live",
      "command": ".venv/bin/meson test -C engine/build/greenfield --print-errorlogs physics model",
      "needs": "native",
      "mutation": {
        "file": "engine/native/physics/helmholtz.hpp",
        "sed": "s/&& parameters.charge_number\\[i\\] \\* parameters.charge_number\\[j\\] > 0;/\\&\\& false;/",
        "expect": "abort"
      },
      "note": "same_sign_exclusion_is_a_limit (physics) and same_sign_pair_is_inert (model) both go red; the published-curve gate below would too"
    },
    {
      "id": "no_hidden_dispersion_default",
      "command": ".venv/bin/meson test -C engine/build/greenfield --print-errorlogs model",
      "needs": "native",
      "mutation": {
        "file": "engine/native/model/helmholtz_model.cpp",
        "sed": "s/require(has_ion == declared, \"ionic_dispersion\");/(void)declared;/",
        "expect": "abort"
      },
      "note": "the constructor rejection is what turns an undeclared fixture into an error; with it removed the Unspecified fixture silently runs the AllIonPairs branch and the rejection check aborts"
    },
    {
      "id": "pressure_slope_is_total",
      "command": ".venv/bin/meson test -C engine/build/greenfield --print-errorlogs model",
      "needs": "native",
      "mutation": {
        "file": "engine/native/model/helmholtz_model.cpp",
        "sed": "s/second\\[3\\] - site_correction;/second[3];/",
        "expect": "abort"
      },
      "note": "red on the three fixtures with sites; ethane alone would stay green, which is why all four cases are in the loop"
    },
    {
      "id": "anchor_respects_branch",
      "command": ".venv/bin/meson test -C engine/build/greenfield --print-errorlogs model",
      "needs": "native",
      "mutation": {
        "file": "engine/native/model/density.cpp",
        "sed": "s/if (far_side_clear)/if (true)/",
        "expect": "abort"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "python_eos_tests",
      "command": ".venv/bin/meson install -C engine/build/greenfield --quiet && (cd engine && ../.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q tests/eos)",
      "needs": "python",
      "mutation": {
        "file": "engine/src/epcsaft/parameters.py",
        "sed": "s/get(\"ionic_dispersion\", \"\")/get(\"ionic_dispersion\", \"exclude-same-sign-ion-pairs\")/",
        "expect": "abort"
